evels for new place and zombies every-time and have a new experience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715350/extras/22f568d87ae849183664ef8fdbf6f68b.poster.avif?t=1554717653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715350/extras/22f568d87ae849183664ef8fdbf6f68b.webm?t=1554717653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715350/extras/22f568d87ae849183664ef8fdbf6f68b.mp4?t=1554717653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>In the dying flames of Ruined City, Creeps have unleashed one final, unholy gamble \u2013 a legion of undead super Zombies &amp; Monsters that threatens to overwhelm the whole of Apocalypse. You have to Fight to save up the humanity from the zombies &amp; monsters menace in this apocalyptic first person shooter vr world!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715350/extras/704f9fdb74d2cdd02692684c38056348.poster.avif?t=1554717653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715350/extras/704f9fdb74d2cdd02692684c38056348.webm?t=1554717653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/715350/extras/704f9fdb74d2cdd02692684c38056348.mp4?t=1554717653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
